{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"From the deck of *The Strix*, she looks down at him. \"I assume it went well?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:33:04.600000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864726169316098058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"More or less. The people were inspired with hope. That's what mattered even if the forces the red coats brought were much better equipped.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:34:01.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864726409216524348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"It's progress. How goes here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:34:31.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864726531963879464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Well, I feel pretty well. I think I might actually be making friends... despite all of this.\" She then gestured to herself.","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:36:01.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864726912902365195","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"That's great! Friends are what keep up spirits in places around here. How long have you been in the city?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:37:02.054000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864727165269835816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She quirked her lip slightly in thought. \"Not that long, really. I've mostly stayed here and Hampstead. How about you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:38:36.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864727559937720340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I've been here most of my life. Family moved here from Ireland when I was but a boy, but they were able to strike it rich by working in their own mines. They struck it rich and gave me the chance to do the things I love and believe in. Using my voice rather than my hands.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:41:07.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864728193415905280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You do have the voice for it.\" She said with a smile. \"I assume you know all there is to know about the city?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:43:09.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864728705308688404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"He gives a wink and a glowing smile\n\"That I do. Every corner, Every hotdog and pizza joint\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:47:29.353000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864729796353064960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She gave a little bit of a look, and then said, playing it as best as she could as if the idea was just an afterthought. \"Well, I *would* like to explore a little bit.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:49:25.268000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864730282535026699","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You said you've only been to Hampstead? Have you tried Ferrytown yet?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:50:02.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864730436734943292","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
